  "solution": {
    "text": "(1) Neutral structures are more stable than charged ones. Therefore I is more stable than II and III.\n(2) +ve charge on less electronegative atom is more stable i.e., $\\mathrm{C}^{\\oplus}$ is more stable than $\\mathrm{O}^{\\oplus}$ Order is I $>$ III $>$ III"
